{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"schema\": \"aos-material-review/v1\", \"request_id\": \"qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013-r1\", \"task_id\": \"qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013\", \"owner\": \"codex-01a13484-f019-7d82-94ce-812396db9124\", \"kind\": \"quality\", \"baseline\": {\"head\": \"6cb7798238ddd1ae859c2f496c39ea9ab4f3c01b\", \"authority_revision\": \"AOS-002015\", \"files\": {\".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/plan-material.txt\": \"c8b07e05b12ab9f032541d5601c19f934ba1cab74d87b9bacc7cc6d6b7b2a896\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/tests-material.txt\": \"7fc5e9ddfc09d3bba6d6e223399259fec2198b15bdbc091e149b5b2a261814b9\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/scope-tests-material.txt\": \"a910d3b38aeb4919deebf3ad4249f57630bd262f363b394ca40f9357bc5c418f\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/command-readonly-material.txt\": \"54aba001a344239613361bc7cf6ab2fd46c738ee063412f1376cd5f93996f0ad\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/workspace-readonly-material.txt\": \"1be77f63b0f408cb67b2692a2b3c6e381454acf6c5ea0c14aadd63751a835a1e\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/compatibility-material.txt\": \"96d8df242fedf2961d65d7b81326e7a84330160ee51ce52e864ecbca8cd7cbce\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/router-diff-material.txt\": \"26769b5f57acdc1497b198606a475397441796a40dff78d46e876666575502ab\"}}, \"claims\": [\"候选仅把两个已审计Operations依赖GET的目录类型换为ReadCatalogDependency，函数体/其他原函数与全部POST保持；实际读取安装门仍不授运行/业务执行权限。\", \"HTTP专项验证两个GET使用新读取门/原tenant/未知参数拒绝，scope测试只允许明确root8+这两个GET；真实pure command DTO六项blocked及external退款门保留，CaseWorkspace源只组合原只读事实/DTO，没有新创建Case或执行调用。\"], \"response_requirements\": {\"format\": \"只返回原始JSON，无Markdown fence或额外解释\", \"required_fields\": [\"request_id\", \"task_id\", \"owner\", \"kind\", \"baseline\", \"verdict\", \"findings\", \"next_safe_step\"], \"next_safe_step\": \"必须是非空具体安全下一步字符串\"}, \"materials\": {\".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/plan-material.txt\": \"# Operations主视图两个只读依赖接线\\n\\nRules：AGENTS.md、AOS工程交付、231/D-wave、完整Goal、单m1写者；先复习方案/登记/RED再最小编码；保留数据与dirty、tenant/exact grant/禁入/原执行门。当前Authority2015，正式新Task同名新owner，root8旧Task准确范围Delivery后router Lease已释放，维护新parent继续active。\\n\\n1/8：产品目标为原统一运营主视图可真实读取并解释原事实/缺口，不以root200、mock或空集合称经营成功。原最新2324同权威卷PG/API/Web全重启/650指纹一致/实际OIDC root8返回200已交付。当前浏览器OperationsPage的Promise.all(root+command readiness+case workspace)有后两项404，导致整体读取失败；19实际辅助404、四页失败、首链仍待。预算不是这两个404根因。\\n\\n2/8目标文件：services/aos-api/aos_api/routers/ecommerce_workshop.py，仅get_ecommerce_operation_case_workspace_view和get_ecommerce_operation_command_readiness将catalog从CatalogDependency换ReadCatalogDependency；函数体/服务构造/POST/其他辅助保持。services/aos-api/tests/test_ecommerce_workshop_read_http.py的明确scope集合扩至root8+这两个已审计GET；未审计GET仍legacy。新增services/aos-api/tests/test_ecommerce_operations_read_dependencies.py，实际HTTP RED测试两GET走独立读取门/正确tenant、command6真实pureDTO全部blocked、案例reader已授权门后原tenant调用；缺安装404和unknown query400保留。证据仅本目录；D-wave登记本波。\\n\\n输入：原真实OIDC principal、当前签名selected ACTIVE5和same exact lock/dataScopeGrant，正常原runtime只读角色。本波READONLY不等于运行准入；安装仍disabled。输出：原CommandReadinessDescriptor六项全部blocked（exact Proposal/Approval/Lease门、退款external门不变）；CaseWorkspace原保留facts/candidate refs/blocked来源，candidate是纯DTO不是创建Case。\\n\\n具体源码审计：EcommerceOperationCommands.read_readiness为pure DTO，无DB/网络/执行方法。EcommerceOperationCaseWorkspace.read→original bounded object/inventory/aftersale SELECT+OperationAuthorityStore.list_cases的read_connect_factory；_source/ref/member_ledger/case_view/candidates/candidate等12helper只在内存组合，tenant检查及external_effect_allowed=false保留；没有append/create/Action.execute/Provider调用。见上一维护目录operations-aux-read-audit.json和root递归审计。读失败0count同时BLOCKED保留，不说成已读真实0成功。\\n\\n3～8/8：HTTP专项RED→仅2注入→相邻root/Operations/CaseWorkspace tests→正常runtime私有冻结只读helper DTO→通过受支持current sourceguard API-only切换并原owned SPA重新读取（不将API-only称新fullPGrestart；aos提醒仍每次fullPG/API/Web同卷）→真实Commands6blocked、workspace来源/未知解释，页面Promise.all进入真实视图→精确冻结Prime/合法消费/Delivery和Authority/Prime，立即下一已登记helper波。最新snapshot不得包括dirty，旧unknown操作/Root脚本不重跑。新的source更换只在维护Task既有授权范围，由当前唯一owner串行。\\n\\n风险/回滚：只读门误用于执行的风险以明确10GET图级scope、POST保留及commandblocked合同保证；新helper发现SQL/Reader/schema问题先真实RED、另精确scope最小修复，不吞错误或放宽dataScope/legacy谓词。回滚仅两处类型注入，不改原数据/全局Role/签名/发布状态，不reset覆盖用户dirty。\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/tests-material.txt\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"Only audited read dependencies recover; command execution stays unavailable.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport pytest\\nfrom aos_api.routers import ecommerce_workshop as routes\\nfrom test_ecommerce_workshop_read_http import client_with_catalogs, ReadReached\\n\\nPATHS = ['/views/operations/cases', '/commands/operations/readiness']\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('path', PATHS)\\ndef test_missing_selected_read_admission_does_not_fall_back_to_legacy(path):\\n    client, legacy, reader = client_with_catalogs()\\n    assert client.get('/v1/ecommerce-workshop' + path).status_code == 404\\n    assert not legacy.calls\\n    assert reader.calls == [dict(module_id='ecommerce.operations',org_id='org-org',project_id='dev-project',roles=['admin'],markings=[])]\\n\\n\\ndef admit(reader):\\n    def get_readiness(**scope):\\n        reader.calls.append(scope)\\n    reader.get_readiness = get_readiness\\n\\n\\ndef test_readiness_returns_original_six_blocked_commands():\\n    client, legacy, reader = client_with_catalogs()\\n    admit(reader)\\n    response = client.get('/v1/ecommerce-workshop/commands/operations/readiness')\\n    assert response.status_code == 200\\n    data = response.json()\\n    assert data['tenant'] == dict(orgId='org-org',projectId='dev-project')\\n    assert len(data['commands']) == 6\\n    assert all(c['status'] == 'blocked' and c['blockers'] for c in data['commands'])\\n    assert not legacy.calls and reader.calls\\n    assert all('EXACT_ACTION_CHAIN_REQUIRED' in {b['code'] for b in c['blockers']} for c in data['commands'] if c['commandId'] != 'refund')\\n    refund = next(c for c in data['commands'] if c['commandId'] == 'refund')\\n    assert refund['blockers'][0]['code'] == 'EXTERNAL_ACTION_GATE_NOT_BOUND'\\n\\n\\ndef test_case_workspace_receives_original_authenticated_tenant():\\n    client, legacy, reader = client_with_catalogs()\\n    admit(reader)\\n    class Probe:\\n        def read(self, **scope):\\n            assert scope == dict(org_id='org-org',project_id='dev-project')\\n            raise ReadReached('case-workspace')\\n    client.app.dependency_overrides[routes.get_ecommerce_operation_case_workspace] = lambda: Probe()\\n    with pytest.raises(ReadReached, match='case-workspace'):\\n        client.get('/v1/ecommerce-workshop/views/operations/cases')\\n    assert not legacy.calls and reader.calls\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('path', PATHS)\\ndef test_unknown_query_cannot_change_tenant_or_reach_catalog(path):\\n    client, legacy, reader = client_with_catalogs()\\n    assert client.get('/v1/ecommerce-workshop' + path + '?orgId=dev-org').status_code == 400\\n    assert not legacy.calls and not reader.calls\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/scope-tests-material.txt\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"HTTP scope fence: only the audited eight roots use installed read admission.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nimport pytest\\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\\nfrom fastapi.testclient import TestClient\\n\\nfrom aos_api.asset_registry.errors import AssetNotFoundError\\nfrom aos_api.auth import Principal, require_principal\\nfrom aos_api.errors import register_exception_handlers\\nfrom aos_api.routers import ecommerce_workshop as routes\\n\\nROOTS = {\\n    'task-cockpit', 'operations', 'content-campaign', 'creator-growth',\\n    'media-studio', 'analyst', 'price-governance', 'customer',\\n}\\n\\n\\nclass RejectingCatalog:\\n    def __init__(self):\\n        self.calls = []\\n\\n    def get_readiness(self, **scope):\\n        self.calls.append(scope)\\n        raise AssetNotFoundError('not installed in current scoped catalog')\\n\\n\\ndef client_with_catalogs():\\n    app = FastAPI()\\n    register_exception_handlers(app)\\n    app.include_router(routes.router)\\n    legacy, reader = RejectingCatalog(), RejectingCatalog()\\n    app.dependency_overrides[routes.get_ecommerce_workshop_catalog] = lambda: legacy\\n    app.dependency_overrides[routes.get_ecommerce_workshop_read_catalog] = lambda: reader\\n    app.dependency_overrides[require_principal] = lambda: Principal(\\n        subject='scope-test', org_id='org-org', project_id='dev-project',\\n        roles=['admin'], markings=[],\\n    )\\n    return TestClient(app), legacy, reader\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('module', sorted(ROOTS))\\ndef test_root_get_uses_scoped_read_admission_before_business_reader(module):\\n    client, legacy, reader = client_with_catalogs()\\n    response = client.get(f'/v1/ecommerce-workshop/views/{module}')\\n    assert response.status_code == 404\\n    assert not legacy.calls\\n    assert len(reader.calls) == 1\\n    assert reader.calls[0] == dict(module_id=f'ecommerce.{module}',\\n        org_id='org-org', project_id='dev-project', roles=['admin'], markings=[])\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('path', [\\n    '/views/customer/contributions', '/views/creator-growth/contributions',\\n    '/modules/ecommerce.operations/readiness',\\n])\\ndef test_unreviewed_get_still_uses_legacy_admission(path):\\n    client, legacy, reader = client_with_catalogs()\\n    response = client.get('/v1/ecommerce-workshop' + path)\\n    assert response.status_code == 404\\n    assert legacy.calls\\n    assert not reader.calls\\n\\n\\ndef test_read_dependency_only_reaches_explicit_audited_get_routes():\\n    actual = set()\\n    for route in routes.router.routes:\\n        uses_read = any(d.call is routes.get_ecommerce_workshop_read_catalog\\n                        for d in route.dependant.dependencies)\\n        if uses_read:\\n            assert route.methods == {'GET'}\\n            actual.add(route.path)\\n    assert actual == {f'/v1/ecommerce-workshop/views/{m}' for m in ROOTS} | {\\n        '/v1/ecommerce-workshop/views/operations/cases',\\n        '/v1/ecommerce-workshop/commands/operations/readiness',\\n    }\\n\\n\\ndef test_unknown_query_rejected_before_catalog_call():\\n    client, legacy, reader = client_with_catalogs()\\n    assert client.get('/v1/ecommerce-workshop/views/operations?orgId=dev-org').status_code == 400\\n    assert not legacy.calls and not reader.calls\\n\\n\\nclass ReadReached(RuntimeError):\\n    pass\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize('module', sorted(ROOTS))\\ndef test_admitted_root_reaches_reader_with_authenticated_tenant(module):\\n    client, legacy, reader = client_with_catalogs()\\n    def admit(**scope):\\n        reader.calls.append(scope)\\n    reader.get_readiness = admit\\n    factory = getattr(routes, 'get_ecommerce_workshop_' + module.replace('-', '_'))\\n    class ProbeReader:\\n        def read(self, **scope):\\n            assert scope['org_id'] == 'org-org'\\n            assert scope['project_id'] == 'dev-project'\\n            raise ReadReached(module)\\n        read_core = read\\n    client.app.dependency_overrides[factory] = lambda: ProbeReader()\\n    with pytest.raises(ReadReached, match=module):\\n        client.get('/v1/ecommerce-workshop/views/' + module)\\n    assert not legacy.calls\\n    assert len(reader.calls) == 1\\n\\n\\ndef test_legacy_success_does_not_build_installed_configuration(monkeypatch):\\n    from aos_api import ecommerce_installed_readonly_catalog as installed\\n    sentinel = object()\\n    class Legacy:\\n        def get_readiness(self, **scope):\\n            return sentinel\\n    def forbidden():\\n        pytest.fail('successful legacy must not inspect selected configuration')\\n    monkeypatch.setattr(installed, 'build_installed_readonly_catalog', forbidden)\\n    catalog = routes.get_ecommerce_workshop_read_catalog(Legacy())\\n    assert catalog.get_readiness(module_id='ecommerce.operations') is sentinel\\n\\n\\ndef test_installed_factory_is_deferred_until_legacy_not_found(monkeypatch):\\n    from aos_api import ecommerce_installed_readonly_catalog as installed\\n    calls = []\\n    def selected():\\n        calls.append('selected')\\n        raise ValueError('configuration sentinel')\\n    monkeypatch.setattr(installed, 'build_installed_readonly_catalog', selected)\\n    catalog = routes.get_ecommerce_workshop_read_catalog(RejectingCatalog())\\n    assert not calls\\n    with pytest.raises(ValueError, match='configuration sentinel'):\\n        catalog.get_readiness(module_id='ecommerce.operations')\\n    assert calls == ['selected']\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/command-readonly-material.txt\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"Read-only W3-12B command readiness for the Operations cockpit.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nfrom datetime import UTC, datetime\\n\\nfrom aos_api.aip_contracts import TenantContext\\nfrom aos_api.ecommerce_operation_command_contracts import (\\n    OperationCommandBlocker,\\n    OperationCommandDescriptor,\\n    OperationCommandId,\\n    OperationCommandReadinessEnvelope,\\n    OperationCommandRisk,\\n    OperationCommandSideEffect,\\n    OperationCommandStatus,\\n)\\n\\n\\n_REQUEST_GOVERNANCE_BLOCKER = OperationCommandBlocker(\\n    code=\\\"EXACT_ACTION_CHAIN_REQUIRED\\\",\\n    dependency=\\\"request-scoped canonical action governance\\\",\\n    required_action=\\\"提交同租户 exact Proposal、有效 Approval、active ExecutionLease 与幂等键\\\",\\n)\\n_EXTERNAL_BLOCKER = OperationCommandBlocker(\\n    code=\\\"EXTERNAL_ACTION_GATE_NOT_BOUND\\\",\\n    dependency=\\\"refund action authority\\\",\\n    required_action=\\\"完成资金动作专项门、maker-checker 与 unknown reconcile 后重新核验\\\",\\n)\\n\\n\\nclass EcommerceOperationCommands:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Returns deterministic fail-closed readiness without mutating authority.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    def read_readiness(\\n        self, *, org_id: str, project_id: str\\n    ) -> OperationCommandReadinessEnvelope:\\n        tenant = TenantContext(org_id=org_id, project_id=project_id)\\n        definitions = (\\n            (\\n                OperationCommandId.CLASSIFY,\\n                \\\"分类事件\\\",\\n                OperationCommandRisk.CONTROLLED,\\n                _REQUEST_GOVERNANCE_BLOCKER,\\n            ),\\n            (\\n                OperationCommandId.CREATE_CASE,\\n                \\\"创建运营工单\\\",\\n                OperationCommandRisk.CONTROLLED,\\n                _REQUEST_GOVERNANCE_BLOCKER,\\n            ),\\n            (\\n                OperationCommandId.CHANGE_MEMBERSHIP,\\n                \\\"调整工单成员\\\",\\n                OperationCommandRisk.CONTROLLED,\\n                _REQUEST_GOVERNANCE_BLOCKER,\\n            ),\\n            (\\n                OperationCommandId.MANAGE_SLA,\\n                \\\"管理服务时限\\\",\\n                OperationCommandRisk.CONTROLLED,\\n                _REQUEST_GOVERNANCE_BLOCKER,\\n            ),\\n        )\\n        commands = [\\n            OperationCommandDescriptor(\\n                command_id=command_id,\\n                label=label,\\n                status=OperationCommandStatus.BLOCKED,\\n                risk=risk,\\n                side_effect=OperationCommandSideEffect.INTERNAL_AUTHORITY,\\n                blockers=[blocker],\\n            )\\n            for command_id, label, risk, blocker in definitions\\n        ]\\n        commands.extend(\\n            [\\n                OperationCommandDescriptor(\\n                    command_id=OperationCommandId.AUTOMATION_KILL,\\n                    label=\\\"停止自动化\\\",\\n                    status=OperationCommandStatus.BLOCKED,\\n                    risk=OperationCommandRisk.HIGH,\\n                    side_effect=OperationCommandSideEffect.INTERNAL_AUTHORITY,\\n                    blockers=[_REQUEST_GOVERNANCE_BLOCKER],\\n                ),\\n                OperationCommandDescriptor(\\n                    command_id=OperationCommandId.REFUND,\\n                    label=\\\"退款\\\",\\n                    status=OperationCommandStatus.BLOCKED,\\n                    risk=OperationCommandRisk.HIGH,\\n                    side_effect=OperationCommandSideEffect.EXTERNAL,\\n                    blockers=[_EXTERNAL_BLOCKER],\\n                ),\\n            ]\\n        )\\n        return OperationCommandReadinessEnvelope(\\n            tenant=tenant,\\n            evaluated_at=datetime.now(UTC),\\n            commands=commands,\\n        )\\n\\n\\n__all__ = [\\\"EcommerceOperationCommands\\\"]\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/workspace-readonly-material.txt\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"Compose formal cross-domain facts into a read-only operation case workspace.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nfrom collections import Counter\\nfrom collections.abc import Callable\\nfrom datetime import UTC, datetime\\nimport hashlib\\nfrom typing import Literal\\n\\nfrom aos_api.aip_contracts import TenantContext\\nfrom aos_api.ecommerce_aftersale_event_reader import (\\n    AftersaleEventOriginal,\\n    EcommerceAftersaleEventReader,\\n    EcommerceAftersaleEventReaderError,\\n)\\nfrom aos_api.ecommerce_inventory_reader import (\\n    EcommerceInventoryReader,\\n    EcommerceInventoryReaderError,\\n)\\nfrom aos_api.ecommerce_operation_case_contracts import (\\n    ExactAuthorityRevisionRef,\\n    ExactOriginalRef,\\n    OperationCaseRevision,\\n    OperationCaseStatus,\\n)\\nfrom aos_api.ecommerce_operation_case_store import (\\n    OperationAuthorityReadError,\\n    OperationAuthorityStore,\\n)\\nfrom aos_api.ecommerce_operation_case_workspace_contracts import (\\n    OperationCaseCandidateKind,\\n    OperationCaseMemberLedger,\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceBlocker,\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceCandidate,\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceCase,\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceEnvelope,\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceLedger,\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSource,\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId,\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceStatus,\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceStatus,\\n)\\nfrom aos_api.ecommerce_operations_object_reader import (\\n    EcommerceOperationsObjectReader,\\n    OperationsObjectReadError,\\n    OperationsObjectRef,\\n)\\nfrom aos_api.tenant_scope import TenantScope\\n\\n\\nClock = Callable[[], datetime]\\n_TRANSACTION_SOURCES = {\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.ORDERS: \\\"Order\\\",\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.SHIPMENTS: \\\"Shipment\\\",\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.PAYMENTS: \\\"Payment\\\",\\n}\\n_FAILURE_CODES = {\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.ORDERS: \\\"OPERATION_CASE_ORDERS_READ_FAILED\\\",\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.INVENTORY: \\\"OPERATION_CASE_INVENTORY_READ_FAILED\\\",\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.SHIPMENTS: \\\"OPERATION_CASE_SHIPMENTS_READ_FAILED\\\",\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.AFTERSALE_EVENTS: \\\"OPERATION_CASE_AFTERSALES_READ_FAILED\\\",\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.PAYMENTS: \\\"OPERATION_CASE_PAYMENTS_READ_FAILED\\\",\\n    OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.OPERATION_CASES: \\\"OPERATION_CASE_AUTHORITY_READ_FAILED\\\",\\n}\\n_MEMBER_FIELDS = {\\n    \\\"Order\\\": \\\"orders\\\",\\n    \\\"OrderLine\\\": \\\"order_lines\\\",\\n    \\\"ProductSku\\\": \\\"inventory\\\",\\n    \\\"Shipment\\\": \\\"shipments\\\",\\n    \\\"Payment\\\": \\\"payments\\\",\\n    \\\"AfterSalesEvent\\\": \\\"aftersale_events\\\",\\n}\\n\\n\\ndef _bare_hash(value: str) -> str:\\n    return value.removeprefix(\\\"sha256:\\\")\\n\\n\\ndef _member_key(item: ExactOriginalRef) -> tuple[str, str, str, str, str]:\\n    return (\\n        item.tenant.org_id,\\n        item.tenant.project_id,\\n        item.resource_type,\\n        item.resource_id,\\n        item.content_hash,\\n    )\\n\\n\\nclass EcommerceOperationCaseWorkspace:\\n    def __init__(\\n        self,\\n        *,\\n        clock: Clock | None = None,\\n        object_reader: EcommerceOperationsObjectReader | None = None,\\n        inventory_reader: EcommerceInventoryReader | None = None,\\n        aftersale_reader: EcommerceAftersaleEventReader | None = None,\\n        case_store: OperationAuthorityStore | None = None,\\n    ) -> None:\\n        self._clock = clock or (lambda: datetime.now(UTC))\\n        self._object_reader = object_reader or EcommerceOperationsObjectReader()\\n        self._inventory_reader = inventory_reader or EcommerceInventoryReader()\\n        self._aftersale_reader = aftersale_reader or EcommerceAftersaleEventReader()\\n        self._case_store = case_store or OperationAuthorityStore()\\n\\n    def read(self, *, org_id: str, project_id: str) -> OperationCaseWorkspaceEnvelope:\\n        cutoff = self._clock()\\n        if cutoff.utcoffset() is None:\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"operation case workspace clock requires a timezone\\\")\\n        tenant = TenantContext(org_id=org_id, project_id=project_id)\\n        scope = TenantScope(org_id=org_id, project_id=project_id)\\n        facts: list[ExactOriginalRef] = []\\n        source_rows: dict[OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId, list[object]] = {}\\n        blocked: set[OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId] = set()\\n\\n        for source_id, object_type in _TRANSACTION_SOURCES.items():\\n            try:\\n                rows = self._object_reader.read(\\n                    org_id=org_id, project_id=project_id,\\n                    object_type=object_type, cutoff=cutoff, limit=50,\\n                )\\n                source_rows[source_id] = rows\\n                facts.extend(self._transaction_ref(item, tenant=tenant) for item in rows)\\n            except OperationsObjectReadError:\\n                source_rows[source_id] = []\\n                blocked.add(source_id)\\n\\n        inventory_items: list[object] = []\\n        try:\\n            inventory = self._inventory_reader.read(\\n                org_id=org_id, project_id=project_id, cutoff=cutoff, limit=50,\\n            )\\n            inventory_items = list(inventory.items)\\n            source_rows[OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.INVENTORY] = inventory_items\\n            facts.extend(self._inventory_ref(item, tenant=tenant) for item in inventory_items)\\n        except EcommerceInventoryReaderError:\\n            source_rows[OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.INVENTORY] = []\\n            blocked.add(OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.INVENTORY)\\n\\n        aftersale_items: list[AftersaleEventOriginal] = []\\n        try:\\n            aftersale_items = self._aftersale_reader.read(\\n                org_id=org_id, project_id=project_id, cutoff=cutoff, limit=50,\\n            )\\n            source_rows[OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.AFTERSALE_EVENTS] = aftersale_items\\n            facts.extend(self._aftersale_ref(item, tenant=tenant) for item in aftersale_items)\\n        except EcommerceAftersaleEventReaderError:\\n            source_rows[OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.AFTERSALE_EVENTS] = []\\n            blocked.add(OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.AFTERSALE_EVENTS)\\n\\n        cases: list[OperationCaseRevision] = []\\n        try:\\n            cases = self._case_store.list_cases(scope, limit=50)\\n            if any(\\n                case.tenant.org_id != org_id\\n                or case.tenant.project_id != project_id\\n                or any(\\n                    member.tenant.org_id != org_id\\n                    or member.tenant.project_id != project_id\\n                    for member in case.member_refs\\n                )\\n                for case in cases\\n            ):\\n                raise OperationAuthorityReadError(\\\"operation case tenant drift\\\")\\n            source_rows[OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.OPERATION_CASES] = cases\\n        except OperationAuthorityReadError:\\n            cases = []\\n            source_rows[OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.OPERATION_CASES] = []\\n            blocked.add(OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId.OPERATION_CASES)\\n\\n        fact_by_key = {_member_key(item): item for item in facts}\\n        assigned_keys = {\\n            _member_key(member)\\n            for case in cases\\n            for member in case.member_refs\\n            if _member_key(member) in fact_by_key\\n        }\\n        available = [item for key, item in fact_by_key.items() if key not in assigned_keys]\\n        available_keys = {_member_key(item) for item in available}\\n        candidates = self._candidates(\\n            inventory_items=inventory_items,\\n            aftersale_items=aftersale_items,\\n            tenant=tenant,\\n            available_keys=available_keys,\\n        )\\n        sources = [\\n            self._source(source_id, source_rows[source_id], source_id in blocked)\\n            for source_id in OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId\\n        ]\\n        if not blocked:\\n            status = OperationCaseWorkspaceStatus.READY\\n        elif len(blocked) == len(OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId):\\n            status = OperationCaseWorkspaceStatus.BLOCKED\\n        else:\\n            status = OperationCaseWorkspaceStatus.PARTIAL\\n        case_views = [self._case_view(item) for item in cases]\\n        return OperationCaseWorkspaceEnvelope(\\n            tenant=tenant,\\n            status=status,\\n            evaluated_at=cutoff,\\n            data_cutoff=cutoff,\\n            sources=sources,\\n            cases=case_views,\\n            candidates=candidates,\\n            available_refs=available,\\n            ledger=OperationCaseWorkspaceLedger(\\n                source_total=len(fact_by_key),\\n                assigned=len(assigned_keys),\\n                unassigned=len(available),\\n                candidates=len(candidates),\\n                open_cases=sum(item.status is OperationCaseStatus.OPEN for item in cases),\\n                paused_cases=sum(item.status is OperationCaseStatus.PAUSED for item in cases),\\n                closed_cases=sum(item.status is OperationCaseStatus.CLOSED for item in cases),\\n            ),\\n            external_effect_allowed=False,\\n        )\\n\\n    @staticmethod\\n    def _source(\\n        source_id: OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceId,\\n        rows: list[object],\\n        failed: bool,\\n    ) -> OperationCaseWorkspaceSource:\\n        if failed:\\n            return OperationCaseWorkspaceSource(\\n                source_id=source_id,\\n                status=OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceStatus.BLOCKED,\\n                count=0,\\n                blocker=OperationCaseWorkspaceBlocker(\\n                    code=_FAILURE_CODES[source_id],\\n                    required_action=\\\"重新核对当前租户同一数据截止的正式来源\\\",\\n                ),\\n            )\\n        return OperationCaseWorkspaceSource(\\n            source_id=source_id,\\n            status=OperationCaseWorkspaceSourceStatus.READY,\\n            count=len(rows),\\n            blocker=None,\\n        )\\n\\n    @staticmethod\\n    def _transaction_ref(item: OperationsObjectRef, *, tenant: TenantContext) -> ExactOriginalRef:\\n        return ExactOriginalRef(\\n            tenant=tenant,\\n            resource_type=item.object_type,\\n            resource_id=item.object_id,\\n            content_hash=_bare_hash(item.content_hash),\\n            source_updated_at=item.source_updated_at,\\n        )\\n\\n    @staticmethod\\n    def _inventory_ref(item: object, *, tenant: TenantContext) -> ExactOriginalRef:\\n        return ExactOriginalRef(\\n            tenant=tenant,\\n            resource_type=\\\"ProductSku\\\",\\n            resource_id=getattr(item, \\\"object_id\\\"),\\n            content_hash=_bare_hash(getattr(getattr(item, \\\"revision\\\"), \\\"content_hash\\\")),\\n            source_updated_at=getattr(item, \\\"source_updated_at\\\"),\\n        )\\n\\n    @staticmethod\\n    def _aftersale_ref(item: AftersaleEventOriginal, *, tenant: TenantContext) -> ExactOriginalRef:\\n        return ExactOriginalRef(\\n            tenant=tenant,\\n            resource_type=\\\"AfterSalesEvent\\\",\\n            resource_id=item.event_id,\\n            content_hash=item.source_hash,\\n            source_updated_at=item.occurred_at,\\n        )\\n\\n    @staticmethod\\n    def _member_ledger(members: list[ExactOriginalRef]) -> OperationCaseMemberLedger:\\n        counts = Counter(_MEMBER_FIELDS[item.resource_type] for item in members)\\n        return OperationCaseMemberLedger(\\n            orders=counts[\\\"orders\\\"],\\n            order_lines=counts[\\\"order_lines\\\"],\\n            inventory=counts[\\\"inventory\\\"],\\n            shipments=counts[\\\"shipments\\\"],\\n            payments=counts[\\\"payments\\\"],\\n            aftersale_events=counts[\\\"aftersale_events\\\"],\\n            total=len(members),\\n        )\\n\\n    @classmethod\\n    def _case_view(cls, item: OperationCaseRevision) -> OperationCaseWorkspaceCase:\\n        return OperationCaseWorkspaceCase(\\n            case_ref=ExactAuthorityRevisionRef(\\n                resource_id=item.case_id,\\n                revision=item.revision,\\n                content_hash=item.content_hash,\\n            ),\\n            version=item.version,\\n            status=item.status,\\n            priority=item.priority,\\n            member_refs=item.member_refs,\\n            member_ledger=cls._member_ledger(item.member_refs),\\n        )\\n\\n    @classmethod\\n    def _candidates(\\n        cls,\\n        *,\\n        inventory_items: list[object],\\n        aftersale_items: list[AftersaleEventOriginal],\\n        tenant: TenantContext,\\n        available_keys: set[tuple[str, str, str, str, str]],\\n    ) -> list[OperationCaseWorkspaceCandidate]:\\n        candidates: list[OperationCaseWorkspaceCandidate] = []\\n        for item in inventory_items:\\n            missing = [\\n                label\\n                for label, value in (\\n                    (\\\"库存数量\\\", getattr(item, \\\"stock\\\")),\\n                    (\\\"告警阈值\\\", getattr(item, \\\"stock_alarm\\\")),\\n                    (\\\"库存健康\\\", getattr(item, \\\"stock_health\\\")),\\n                )\\n                if value is None\\n            ]\\n            if not missing:\\n                continue\\n            ref = cls._inventory_ref(item, tenant=tenant)\\n            if _member_key(ref) not in available_keys:\\n                continue\\n            candidates.append(cls._candidate(\\n                kind=OperationCaseCandidateKind.INVENTORY_DATA_GAP,\\n                title=\\\"库存资料待核对\\\",\\n                summary=f\\\"商品库存缺少{'、'.join(missing)}，需补齐正式来源后再处理。\\\",\\n                priority=\\\"high\\\",\\n                ref=ref,\\n            ))\\n        for item in aftersale_items:\\n            ref = cls._aftersale_ref(item, tenant=tenant)\\n            if _member_key(ref) not in available_keys:\\n                continue\\n            candidates.append(cls._candidate(\\n                kind=OperationCaseCandidateKind.AFTERSALE_FOLLOWUP,\\n                title=\\\"售后事项待处理\\\",\\n                summary=(\\n                    f\\\"售后事项类型为 {item.event_type}、状态为 {item.status}，\\\"\\n                    \\\"需运营人员确认内部处理路径。\\\"\\n                ),\\n                priority=\\\"normal\\\",\\n                ref=ref,\\n            ))\\n        return candidates\\n\\n    @staticmethod\\n    def _candidate(\\n        *,\\n        kind: OperationCaseCandidateKind,\\n        title: str,\\n        summary: str,\\n        priority: Literal[\\\"normal\\\", \\\"high\\\"],\\n        ref: ExactOriginalRef,\\n    ) -> OperationCaseWorkspaceCandidate:\\n        identity = f\\\"{kind.value}:{ref.resource_type}:{ref.resource_id}:{ref.content_hash}\\\"\\n        return OperationCaseWorkspaceCandidate(\\n            candidate_id=hashlib.sha256(identity.encode()).hexdigest(),\\n            kind=kind,\\n            title=title,\\n            summary=summary,\\n            priority=priority,\\n            member_refs=[ref],\\n            external_effect_allowed=False,\\n        )\\n\\n\\n__all__ = [\\\"EcommerceOperationCaseWorkspace\\\"]\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/compatibility-material.txt\": \"{\\n  \\\"head\\\": \\\"6cb7798238ddd1ae859c2f496c39ea9ab4f3c01b\\\",\\n  \\\"changedOriginalFunctionsOnlyAnnotation\\\": [\\n    \\\"get_ecommerce_operation_case_workspace_view\\\",\\n    \\\"get_ecommerce_operation_command_readiness\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"allOtherOriginalFunctionsAstEqual\\\": true,\\n  \\\"commandsAvailable\\\": false,\\n  \\\"currentApiLoaded\\\": false,\\n  \\\"businessComplete\\\": false\\n}\\n\", \".evidence/qyh-operations-read-dependencies-20261013/router-diff-material.txt\": \"diff --git a/services/aos-api/aos_api/routers/ecommerce_workshop.py b/services/aos-api/aos_api/routers/ecommerce_workshop.py\\nindex c586990fe..a2cced794 100644\\n--- a/services/aos-api/aos_api/routers/ecommerce_workshop.py\\n+++ b/services/aos-api/aos_api/routers/ecommerce_workshop.py\\n@@ -1397,7 +1397,7 @@ def get_ecommerce_workshop_operations_view(\\n def get_ecommerce_operation_case_workspace_view(\\n     request: Request,\\n     principal: PrincipalDependency,\\n-    catalog: CatalogDependency,\\n+    catalog: ReadCatalogDependency,\\n     workspace: OperationCaseWorkspaceDependency,\\n ) -> OperationCaseWorkspaceEnvelope:\\n     _reject_query_parameters(request)\\n@@ -2725,7 +2725,7 @@ def get_ecommerce_workshop_shared_context_view(\\n def get_ecommerce_operation_command_readiness(\\n     request: Request,\\n     principal: PrincipalDependency,\\n-    catalog: CatalogDependency,\\n+    catalog: ReadCatalogDependency,\\n     commands: OperationCommandsDependency,\\n ) -> OperationCommandReadinessEnvelope:\\n     _reject_query_parameters(request)\\n\"}}"}],"timestamp":1791887108191},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"request_id\": \"qyh-operations-read-dependencies-202610